schema: resource
object:
  title: DeVouch
  type: resource
  resource_type: verification-protocol
  original_source: src/content/docs/giveth-donations.md
  notes: >-
    "A system for members of reputable organizations in the Ethereum
    ecosystem to vouch for or flag projects that are looking to raise
    funding" (quoted in the article). Decentralizes Giveth's project
    verification: trusted verifiers issue on-chain vouches worth 1, 3, or 30
    points by tier; 3 points unlocks GIVpower boost, 30 points unlocks donor
    GIVbacks eligibility. No standalone URL given in this article.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/giveth-donations.md
    transformation: quoted
    authorship: ai-assisted
